<h1>Justin J. Kumar</h1>
<p>Illinois House, 12th District, on the Chicago ballot November 3, 2026. Party: Republican.</p>
<p><a href="https://kumarforil12.com" rel="nofollow noopener">Campaign site (kumarforil12.com)</a></p>
<h2>Running on</h2>
<p>Lists fiscal responsibility, including a full review of the state budget, public safety, infrastructure, and lowering costs for food, medicine, transportation, education, and property taxes as his priorities. Says he would emphasize bipartisan collaboration and practical problem-solving.</p>
<h2>Background</h2>
<p>President and CEO of Frontload Group LLC, an investment holding company, with a background in private equity and venture capital, and a board member of the Lupus Society of Illinois.</p>
